REM loading_bar.duck [FUNNY] - types a fake progress log. Harmless.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 10
STRINGLN Loading something very important...
STRING [#####               ] 25%
DELAY 700
STRINGLN
STRING [##########          ] 50%
DELAY 700
STRINGLN
STRING [###############     ] 75%
DELAY 700
STRINGLN
STRINGLN [####################] 100%
STRINGLN Task failed successfully.
